pan></strong></span></td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: Pro;">&nbsp;Цена от</span></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: Pro; color: #a22521;">Практический интернет-маркетинг. Полный курс</span></strong></span>\r\n<p><span style="font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;">Очно и дистанционно.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;">23.09.19</span></td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Pro;">13 900</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff;"><span style="color: #a22521; font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;"><b>SEO-оптимизация и контекстная реклама</b></span><br />\r\n<p><span style="font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;">Очно и дистанционно.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Pro;">23.09.19</span><br /><br /></td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Pro;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;10 500</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff;"><span style="color: #a22521; font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;"><b>SMM. Работа с социальными сетями</b></span><br />\r\n<p><span style="font-family: Pro; font-size: 10pt;">Очно и дистанционно.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Pro;">29.04.19</span></td>\r\n<td style="border-color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: P